What is AI?
Sorry, I only handle mathematical queries.


Troubleshooting

Invalid API Key: Ensure your Groq API key is valid. Generate a new key at https://console.groq.com/ if needed.
Model Issues: The llama-3.3-70b-versatile model is used. Check Groq documentation for model updates.
Dependency Errors: Verify all required libraries are installed and up to date.
Invalid Inputs: Non-numeric inputs in arithmetic queries return "Invalid numerical input."

Limitations

The regex for simple arithmetic supports integers and decimals but not complex expressions (e.g., "2 + 3 * 4"). Extend the regex or add parsing logic for advanced arithmetic.
The LLM may occasionally misinterpret queries as non-mathematical. Refine the prompt if needed.
No query history is stored; add session state storage for multi-turn conversations if desired.

